WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.624
This tour shows the administration pages that run the site.

2
00:00:05.124 --> 00:00:08.110
You see only the pages your role allows.

3
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:15.153
Everything is in the menu on the left, in alphabetical order.

4
00:00:20.069 --> 00:00:25.519
The Admin guide explains every page, with pictures, and this video is there too.

5
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:34.088
The pages of Drupal itself, such as Appearance and Structure, are rarely needed.

6
00:00:36.878 --> 00:00:41.981
Bibles lists the translations on the site, with how many verses each has.

7
00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:47.389
Upload a Bible as a text file, check the preview, and confirm.

8
00:00:48.642 --> 00:00:54.858
A new Bible stays hidden until you publish it, and Hide takes one off the site without deleting it.

9
00:00:57.617 --> 00:01:02.229
Commentaries, Devotionals, and Other books all work the same way.

10
00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:09.831
Upload a PDF, a Word document, or an ebook, and its headings, lists, and pictures are kept.

11
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:17.558
Edit changes the name, the author, the credit line, and the keywords, without uploading it again.

12
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:29.437
At the foot of the page, Kindle books link to books in Amazon's Kindle reader, each with a picture of its cover.

13
00:01:32.197 --> 00:01:38.112
Christian music holds the songs and talks: an MP3 or MP4 each, with its words.

14
00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:46.730
Drop several files on the box at the top to upload them all at once. To use a picture you copied, press Paste a picture.

15
00:01:47.263 --> 00:01:52.086
A song or album on Spotify can be added too, from its share link.

16
00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:57.069
Maps work the same way, each with the Bible verses it goes with.

17
00:02:04.497 --> 00:02:08.275
Site users are the accounts of the people who use the site.

18
00:02:08.779 --> 00:02:12.553
Click Name or Email at the top of a column to sort the list.

19
00:02:13.679 --> 00:02:22.867
Edit an account to confirm its address, or to let it write in Conversations, mark the maps, share lists, or be emailed every new post.

20
00:02:23.386 --> 00:02:28.276
Tick, Texts on, only when the member has agreed to get text messages.

21
00:02:31.031 --> 00:02:38.773
Conversations and Prayer Wall lists every post, with its real author, even when a request was posted anonymously.

22
00:02:39.303 --> 00:02:44.707
Read and delete shows a post with its replies, so you can remove what should not be there.

23
00:02:47.464 --> 00:02:52.030
Groups are for the people you look after, such as a care group or a class.

24
00:02:54.605 --> 00:02:58.590
Add members from the site's accounts, or people without one.

25
00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:08.633
Send a message, a verse card, or a picture message. Each member gets it the way they chose, by email or by text, and replies come to you.

26
00:03:09.142 --> 00:03:14.475
Or schedule an email, such as every Tuesday morning, with one of your signatures.

27
00:03:20.596 --> 00:03:23.964
Click a member's address to write to that person alone.

28
00:03:30.907 --> 00:03:34.137
And the Sent table keeps a copy of every email.

29
00:03:38.363 --> 00:03:43.849
Tasks are jobs that come round again, such as communion on the first Sunday of the month.

30
00:03:44.389 --> 00:03:50.966
Each task can send the person two reminders, a week and a day before, by email or by text.

31
00:03:51.474 --> 00:03:59.083
Schedule tasks fills a whole day at once: choose the date, press plus beside a task, and choose the person.

32
00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:06.793
Message a day writes to everyone scheduled on one date, with attachments if you like.

33
00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:14.094
And the Scheduled Task Report prints a sign-up sheet, day by day.

34
00:04:16.863 --> 00:04:22.589
FAQ questions sets the questions on the FAQ page, in order under their headings.

35
00:04:23.104 --> 00:04:28.101
About this site tells the A.I. who your readers are, so its answers fit them.

36
00:04:28.626 --> 00:04:32.230
FAQ notes adds your own words under an answer.

37
00:04:34.962 --> 00:04:40.063
Site settings has the site's title, its welcome words, and its icons.

38
00:04:40.588 --> 00:04:44.610
Login required keeps the whole site for logged-in members.

39
00:04:45.146 --> 00:04:51.848
Check posts with A.I. asks Google Gemini to check each post and reply before it is saved.

40
00:04:52.366 --> 00:04:57.142
Further down are the email server, and the keys of the outside services.

41
00:05:05.461 --> 00:05:11.584
Backup and restore saves the whole site in three zip files, in a folder on your own computer.

42
00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:17.098
To restore, choose the zips of one backup, and type RESTORE to confirm.

43
00:05:19.843 --> 00:05:23.608
The Admin guide has all of this in writing, with pictures.

44
00:05:24.108 --> 00:05:25.780
Thank you for watching.
